  "verseCount": 50,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī ongeja kūhaya, “Nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, balīho bamò ū mu banhū abo bīmīīlaga aha batūloja icha na hado yaya, kūshisha babūbone ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu būliza mu būdūla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu kūgalūka ihanga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya shikū itandatū ū Yesu ūbasola ba Petelo na Yakobo na Yohana, benabo dūhū, ūbatongeela ajile mu lūgūlū lūlīhu, ūlinha nabo. Kūhayimanīla ī lihanga lyakwe lyagalūka balolile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nī shizwalo shakwe sheela pe, shiyūng'weka ng'weka; atīho mfuji nūūlū ūmò ū mu sī ūyo adūgije kweja gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būbilongela ba Eliya na Musa, bandya kūlūngalūnga nang'hwe ū Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Petelo ūng'wīla ū Yesu gīkī, “Nangi yabeelela īkī twabiza tūlīho aha, ī gete tūzenge maheema adatū, līmò lyako, līmò lya ng'wa Musa, na līmò lya ng'wa Eliya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakogoha no, ūbbaha ūyūhaya mihayo īyo walī atīmanaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bahayimanīla bafīkījiwa ilunde, n'ilaka ligela kūfuma ū ng'wilunde līlīhaya, “Ūyū ng'wene Ng'wana wane Ntogwa, ng'wigwagi wei.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama hangī bahayimanīla haho na haho boya kūmona ose ose, ūlū atī Yesu dūhū hamò nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho balika ū mu lūgūlū, ūbahana batizūng'wīla munhū ose ose īyo bakībona yenīyo, kūshisha aho Ng'wana wa Munhū alajūūke kūfuma mu bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū mhayo gwenūyo bakagūlang'hana gūbiza gwabo dūhū, gwike bakayibūja būja a makūlū ga kūjūūka kūfuma mu bafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakīīta nose būmūja balīhaya, “Nibūlī a balangi bakahayaga gīkī, shiigelile ize Eliya tame?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja alīhaya gīkī, “Ū Eliya ū ng'wene ng'hana ntongi ū kwiza, kūlwa kūlonja lonja yose. Al'ī gīsī nibūlī ū Ng'wana wa Munhū andīkīlilwe gīkī, shing'wigeleelilwe aluhiwe no no no, na kūleng'wa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nalīmuwīla gīkī, ū Eliya wamalile ū kwiza, nīyo būng'wītīla gīt'ūmo batogelilwe; ūmo andīkīlilwe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyanda kwīngījiwa isamva",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bashika ū kū bahemba a bangī, būbasanga bapīndiagwa ibita itaale; baalīho na balangi ba shilagīlo bihalalījaga nabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū aho bamona bakakumya, alīyo haho na haho būmpeeleela kūjūngīsha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbabūja, “Mulihalalīja mhayo kī nabo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò ū ng'wibita lyenīlo ūnshokeja alīhaya gīkī, “Nangi kaka kitūnja kane nakwenhelaga, kalī n'isamva lya būshimuumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū lyakadadīla līkakagalagajaga, kayūfuluuta ifulo dūhū, ū kūnū kaligadagūja a mino, nose kaakaba! Naalī nabawīla a bahemba bako balīpeeje, alīyo balīlemeelagwa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūbashokeja alīhaya, “Bing'we shibyalīlwe sha būtūzunya, nakwikala nalī ning'we kūshisha nanalī? Nakwiyūmīlīja hamò ning'we kūshisha nanalī? Ng'wenhagi halī nene aha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būntwala a halī Yesu. Ū nyanda aho wamona dūhū ū Yesu, lyūntaalīka ha sī ī lisamva, wandya kūfuluuta ifulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu ūmūja ū ise o nyanda gīkī, “Alī na makanza kī gandimile a makoye genaya?” Nang'hwe ūnshokeja, “Kūfuma ha būnīgīnī bokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ng'hangala ningī līkakagwisījaga na mu moto, nūūlū mu minzī, gīkī līkabūlage. Ūlū ūdūgije kwīta mhayo gose gose, tūkūlīlagwe ūtūgunanhe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Gīkī ūlū ūdūgije? Angū pyī ī yose īdūlīkanile ū kūlī munhū wa kūzunya!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haho na haho ū ise o nyanda ūlīla alīhaya, “Baba nazunije, gwike nīngījage ū būhana hani bone!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho wabona gīkī ī libita lya banhū lyandya kwiza līlīpeela nhambo, ūlīhama ī lisamva, ūlīwīla, “Bebe moyo nsoso gwa būshimuumu na būgulu, nalīkūlagīla ūmfume, nīyo ūtizūnshokela hangī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lyūng'haja hangī ū nyanda, wandya kūfuluuta ifulo, hūna lyūmfuma, lyūneka gītī waacha, nose a bingī būyiganika gīkī hamo waacha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu, ūndima ū nkono gokwe, ūngūngūmūla, wīmīīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū wei wingīla mu kaya. Aho wasaaga iyene na bahemba bakwe dūhū, būmūja gīkī, “Nibūlī a bise twalī twalemeelagwa ū kūlīpeeja?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūbashokeja gīkī, “Ī mbika gītī īyī ītīko kūfuma na hado yaya ūlū ītī mu kūlomba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbawīla hangī ya kūcha na kūjūūka kwakwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho bīnga a henaho būbītīla Galilaya. Ū Yesu walī atatogilwe munhū adeebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno obalangaga a bahemba bakwe gīkī, “Ū Ng'wana wa Munhū akūtūūlwa mu makono ga babūlagi bamūlage, alīyo ūlū ūcha akūjūūka ha numa ya shikū idatū.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike batagwitegelegije ū mhayo gwenūyo, hama nū kūmūja baalī bogoha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ū ntaale kūbatinda pye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakīīta būshika Kapelanaumu, aho bingīla mu kaya ūbabūja gīkī, “Ū mu nzīla ng'walihalalījaga mihayo kī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būhuumūla sele, nguno ū mu nzīla bihalalīgījaga mhayo gwa būtaale; gīkī nani ū ntaale kūbatinda pye a biye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wigasha ūbitana abo ikūmi na babīlī, ūbawīla gīkī, “Ūlū munhū ūtogwa kūbiza wa kwandya, shiigelile abize kū numa ya bose, na ntūmami wa bose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna witana kanīgīnī ūkawīla kīmīīla hamò nabo, wanoga ūkakumbatīla na makono gakwe. Hūna ūbawīla gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ūlū munhū ūng'wanukūla ūmò wa banīgīnī gīt'ūyū mu lina lyane, wananukūlaga nene. Hama ūyo ūnanukūla nene, atananukūlile nene dūhū, alīyo wang'wanukūlaga ūyo anitūmile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī kū lwandī lwise",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla ū Yohana wang'wīla gīkī, “Nangi twalī twamonile ng'wing'wana alīpeeja masamva mu lina lyako; tūnemeja nguno atī ūmò wise!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūng'wīla, “Yaya ū kūnemeja, nguno atīho munhū wa kūbeeja mhayo gwa būdūla mu lina lyane, hūna hangī ūshoka kūnihaya kībi haho na haho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo atī ng'wilwisha wise, ū ng'wenūyo alī kū lwandī lwise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī munhū ūyo ūng'winha a bing'we minzī ga kūng'wa, īkī mulī ba ng'wa Kilisito, nalīmuwīla gwa ng'hana gīkī, ū ng'wenūyo atūjimīīja ī mheela yakwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo ya kwipamya banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Na hangī ūlū munhū ūng'wenheleja kwipama nūūlū ūmò wa bado bado abo banisanije nene benaba, īkūbiza hambū hambū atungīlījiwe ū mu nhingo yakwe iwe lya kūshela, akaponejiwe mu nyanza shimu, achīle ng'wenūmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, nūūlū nkono gwako ūlū gūkwipamya, gūbbutage, īlī hambū hambū wingīle ū mu būpanga ūlī nemehazu, kūtinda kūbiza na makono abīlī alīyo ūponyiwa mu nsango gwa moto gwa būja na būja. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūmo jilīmo shagembe jitachaaga, nū moto gwamo gūtajimaga.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū lūpambala lwako ūlū lūkwipamya lūbbutage, īlī hambū hambū wingīle ū mu būpanga ūlī gigī, kūtinda kūbiza na mhambala ibīlī, alīyo ūponyiwa mu nsango gwa moto, [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūmo shagembe jamo jitachaaga, nū moto gūtajimaga.] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū liso lyako lyūkwenheleja kwipama, līkobolage ūlyīnje ho. Nguno īlī hambū hambū wingīle ū mu būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu ūlī na songo, kūtinda kūbiza na miso abīlī alīyo ūponyiwa mu nsango gwa moto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmo shagembe jamo jitachaaga, nū moto gūtajimaga! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ng'wene akūbītiwa mu munhu ejiwe ū būsoso bokwe, gīt'ūmo shitambo shikeejiagwa bo kūtūūlīlwa munhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 9:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū munhu gūlī ng'wiza, alīyo ūlū gūlinda gūsūūka, ī gīsī mukūgūtwīla kī gūsandūke hangī? Na lūūlū bizagi na munhu ū mu bing'we, hū mukwikala mulī mhola būlī ng'wene na biye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.9.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.9.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
